  "body": "This luxury, spacious ground-floor two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment in The Horizon complex presents an outstanding lock-and-leave lifestyle opportunity.\r\n\r\nOffering approximately 92m2 (more or less) of refined interiors, featuring blonded European oak floors, Miele appliances with integrated fridge/freezer, Italian stone benchtops, and an impressive 2.7m stud height. \r\nFloor-to-ceiling glazing enhances the light-filled open-plan living, seamlessly connecting to the outdoors. Two generous double bedrooms include a master with ensuite.\r\n\r\nA rare highlight is the expansive north-facing private courtyard (approx. 77.5m2) perfect for alfresco entertaining.\r\n\r\nSecure garaging for two cars, storage, and a pet-friendly, well-managed building. Eastridge Shopping Centre, cafes, transport, and Eastern Bays beaches are all just moments away.",
